        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Cat named Gossamergoober accompanied with an awesome groovy original sound track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, collect chicken and catch the bugs in this adorable platformer for anyone that loves cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for beginner gamers to learning PC gaming and/or keyboard platforming and/or controller gamepad platforming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes various casual fun game modes and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Bugs Mode involves catching all of the bugs before Gossamergoober runs out of energy and falls asleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Barnicle Mode involves searching for and finding Barnicle the Elder Cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now including an all New Gossamergoober World content update. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including with 28 world stages to play through and complete in order </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set times for completing stages and try and get your best times for each mode and stage completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for collectable music boxes and unlock the playable OST sound tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various challenge Trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access options that change the gameplay accessibility (example: removing the background) for casual play and/or music options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Cat named Gossamergoober accompanied with an awesome groovy original sound track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, collect chicken and catch the bugs in this adorable platformer for anyone that loves cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for beginner gamers to learning PC gaming and/or keyboard platforming and/or controller gamepad platforming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes various casual fun game modes and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Bugs Mode involves catching all of the bugs before Gossamergoober runs out of energy and falls asleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Barnicle Mode involves searching for and finding Barnicle the Elder Cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now including an all New Gossamergoober World content update. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including with 28 world stages to play through and complete in order </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set times for completing stages and try and get your best times for each mode and stage completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for collectable music boxes and unlock the playable OST sound tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various challenge Trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access options that change the gameplay accessibility (example: removing the background) for casual play and/or music options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1787619338\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1787619338 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p>",
